================================================================================
TROUBLESHOOTING ACCESS ISSUES
================================================================================

Issue: "Invalid Credentials" Error
Cause: Email/password combination doesn't exist
Solution:
- Double-check email spelling (case-insensitive)
- Verify password exactly as set
- Use "Forgot Password" to reset
- Ensure account has been created/seeded

---

Issue: "Email Not Verified"
Cause: User hasn't confirmed email address
Solution:
- Check inbox for verification email
- Click verification link
- Check spam/junk folder
- Request resend on login page

---

Issue: "Account Pending Approval"
Cause: Admin hasn't approved teacher/user yet
Solution:
- Contact administrator
- Admin goes to Admin > Staff & Users > Pending
- Admin clicks "Approve"
- User receives notification

---

Issue: "Cannot Connect to Database"
Error: SQLSTATE HY000 (2002) - Connection refused
Solution:
- Ensure MySQL is running
- Verify .env file has correct DB credentials
- Test connection: mysql -u root -p -h 127.0.0.1
- Check MySQL port is 3306

---

Issue: "My Students Aren't Showing"
Cause: Teacher not assigned to daycare/section
Solution:
- Admin must assign teacher to daycare
- Admin must assign teacher to section
- Refresh page
- Check if students are archived
- Wait for admin to approve pending enrollments

---

Issue: "Can't Upload Enrollment Documents"
Cause: File size or format issue
Solution:
- Check file size (max 10MB)
- Use supported formats: PDF, JPG, PNG
- Check internet connection
- Try different browser
- Ensure sufficient disk space

================================================================================
ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION (.env FILE)
================================================================================

Application Settings:
APP_NAME=Laravel
APP_ENV=local (change to 'production' for live server)
APP_DEBUG=true (change to false in production)
APP_KEY=(auto-generated)
APP_URL=http://localhost:8000
APP_TIMEZONE=Asia/Manila
BCRYPT_ROUNDS=12

Database Settings:
DB_CONNECTION=sqlite (or mysql, pgsql, sqlsrv)
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=laravel
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=
DB_CHARSET=utf8mb4
DB_COLLATION=utf8mb4_unicode_ci

Session & Cache:
SESSION_DRIVER=database
SESSION_LIFETIME=120
CACHE_STORE=database

Queue & Broadcasting:
QUEUE_CONNECTION=database
BROADCAST_CONNECTION=log

File Storage:
FILESYSTEM_DISK=local

Mail Configuration:
MAIL_MAILER=log (change to 'smtp' in production)
MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS="hello@example.com"

================================================================================
SECURITY CHECKLIST - BEFORE PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT
================================================================================

✓ Change default admin password immediately
✓ Update APP_DEBUG to false
✓ Set APP_ENV to production
✓ Generate strong APP_KEY (already done via key:generate)
✓ Use strong, unique DB_PASSWORD
✓ Enable HTTPS/SSL certificates
✓ Set secure session timeout values
✓ Enable email verification for all users
✓ Implement password reset capability
✓ Configure database backups
✓ Restrict database access to app server only
✓ Never commit .env file to version control
✓ Update all dependencies to latest versions
✓ Implement activity logging and monitoring
✓ Set up error tracking (Sentry recommended)
✓ Configure secure file storage
✓ Implement GDPR compliance measures
✓ Test login and access controls
✓ Document all custom configurations

